(Note: The setup will silently install Python, FFmpeg, and required libraries if they are missing. It will then configure Dvisor to start automatically in the background.)

💡 How to Use
Once the setup is complete, you never need to open PowerShell again!

Simply copy any Facebook or YouTube video link.

Wait a few seconds for the confirmation beep.

Open WhatsApp Desktop (or any app), press Ctrl + V, and your physical video file will be pasted automatically!
